⏭️ WebRtcTransportProvider delayed processing of SolicitOffer on release 1.5.1 or later on Camera (TC_WEBRTCP_2_27.py)
   ↳ The test is buggy. It sends SolicitOffer with explicit videoStreams/audioStreams and then asserts deferredOffer is TRUE unconditionally. Matter 1.6.0 §11.5.6.1 sets DeferredOffer TRUE only "If in standby mode", and FALSE otherwise; §11.5.6.2.2 then requires the stream ids to be non-null when it is FALSE. A Matterbridge camera is never in standby, so returning FALSE here is spec-correct and the assert can never hold.
